====1F (East)====
The path diverges inside the eastern island. A ladder leads to an upper chamber that houses the relocated [[Cinnabar Gym]], while an ice-encrusted stairway leads down into the heart of the [[Seafoam Islands]].

====Cinnabar Gym====
